<title>RUSSIA: Prices fall in Armenia by 1.1 pct in September.</title>
<headline>Prices fall in Armenia by 1.1 pct in September.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Armenian consumer prices fell by 1.1 percent in September after a 0.3-percent rise in August, the National Statistics Committee said.</p>
<p>    ARMENIA CONSUMER PRICES    SEP 96    AUG 96    SEP 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	 -1.1	+0.3	-0.1</p>
<p>The committee said prices in September were 1.3-percent higher than in December 1995. In the first nine months of this year, prices rose 22.1 percent over year-ago levels</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
